{"id":"6bad767147d20671","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-baire-prefix-continuity.md","title":"Baire空间上的前缀连续性","display":"df-baire-prefix-continuity — Baire空间上的前缀连续性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity","aliases":["72-df-baire-prefix-continuity"],"display":"df-baire-prefix-continuity — Baire空间上的前缀连续性","depends_on":[],"chapter":"VI","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VI §2.5–2.6, print425–427/PDF437–439; local topological formulation","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-baire-prefix-continuity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-baire-prefix-continuity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-baire-prefix-continuity — Baire空间上的前缀连续性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VI"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VI §2.5–2.6, print425–427/PDF437–439; local topological formulation"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega\">\\(F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(s\\in\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\subseteq\\alpha\">\\(s\\subseteq\\alpha\\)</span> 是有限函数图包含。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat s\">\\(\\widehat s\\)</span> 将 s 以零补成一条全分支。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat s(i):=\\begin{cases}s(i),&amp;i&lt;|s|,\\\\0,&amp;|s|\\le i.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat s(i):=\\begin{cases}s(i),&amp;i&lt;|s|,\\\\0,&amp;|s|\\le i.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n(\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright n=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright n\\Rightarrow F(\\alpha)=F(\\beta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n(\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright n=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright n\\Rightarrow F(\\alpha)=F(\\beta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ (s\\subseteq\\beta\\Rightarrow F(\\beta)=F(\\widehat s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ (s\\subseteq\\beta\\Rightarrow F(\\beta)=F(\\widehat s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是到离散自然数空间的逐点连续性，不要求统一前缀长度。每个有限串都有指定的零延长，故柱集上的参考值总有定义。它与本册邻域函数接口直接匹配，没有引入可计算性假设。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"s\\subseteq\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat s","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat s(i):=\\begin{cases}s(i),&i<|s|,\\\\0,&|s|\\le i.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\alpha\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ \\exists n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\\n(\\alpha\\!\\upharpoonright n=\\beta\\!\\upharpoonright n\\Rightarrow F(\\alpha)=F(\\beta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ConstCyl}(F,s):\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ (s\\subseteq\\beta\\Rightarrow F(\\beta)=F(\\widehat s)).","display":true}],"bytes":1622,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"d4505d236865c21c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$F:\\omega^\\omega\\to\\omega$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Cont}_B(F)$；$s\\in\\omega^{<\\omega}$。$\\operatorname{ConstCyl}$ 与零延长取 [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]]。"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]] · [[72-thm-quantifier-free-number-realizability]]"},{"id":"7090d31a0efe845d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-50","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VI章新增9项：[[72-df-applicative-simultaneous-substitution]] · [[72-df-baire-prefix-continuity]] · [[72-df-continuous-functional-neighborhood-code]] · [[72-df-quantifier-free-realizability-fragment]] · [[72-ex-baire-no-uniform-prefix]] · [[72-lem-applicative-semantic-substitution]] · [[72-lem-realizability-environment-locality]] · [[72-thm-neighborhood-representation]]